{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17323615","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17323615","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1732361501:1":{"text":"국왕님이 건강을 회복하신 건 좋은 일이죠.","source_cn":"国王陛下恢复了健康，这于王都是件好事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B5E7A754926D353","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732361502:1":{"text":"레오프론이 안정되어야 장사도 잘 될 테니까요...","source_cn":"毕竟只有国家稳定，商业经济才能蓬勃发展……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE46D9AB146CE1EBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732361503:1":{"text":"그런데 국왕님이 앞으로 어떤 정책을 펼치실지 모른다는 게 문제예요.","source_cn":"但问题是，我们不清楚国王后续会推行怎样的商业政策。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7789F835FDA36861","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1732361504:1":{"text":"여왕님은 저희한테 유리한 정책을 펼치셔서, 거기에 맞춰서 움직였거든요.","source_cn":"之前王后推行的政策对我们有利，我们也相应调整了计划。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2E14640539B8B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1732361505:1":{"text":"국왕님이 돌아오신 뒤에도 계속 그럴까요?","source_cn":"现在陛下重新执政，那些政策是不是也不作数了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BFB54B167D01A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1732361506:1":{"text":"모든 게 뒤죽박죽됐어요. 이제 어떻게 해야 하죠?","source_cn":"一切都乱了套。我们该怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1A33B2681DA34D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1732361507:1":{"text":"국왕님이 기존 정책을 폐기한다고 명확히 말씀하신 적은 없어서 아직 함부로 추측할 때는 아니지만요.","source_cn":"冷静点。陛下没有明确说要取消之前的政策，不要胡乱臆想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72A740A38638D631","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1732361508:1":{"text":"계획을 섣불리 바꾸면 더 혼란스러워질 테니, 더 알아본 뒤에 움직여야겠어요...","source_cn":"随意改变计划只会让事情变得更混乱。我们需要进一步了解情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD3C6F3480D5662","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:手工业者卡拉":{"text":"수공업자 카라","source":"手工业者卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:手工业者奇科普":{"text":"수공업자 치코푸","source":"手工业者奇科普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:手工业者莉娜":{"text":"수공업자 리나","source":"手工业者莉娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}